    <p class="more">
      How apps are shipped, and when an app you did not write runs confined:{" "}
      <a href="/docs/guides/opening-an-app/">opening an app</a>,{" "}
      <a href="/docs/guides/untrusted-apps/">apps you did not write</a>.
